<title>USA: Prime Service sets offer at $23.50/shr.</title>
<headline>Prime Service sets offer at $23.50/shr.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prime Service Inc said Thursday that it priced its 7.25 million share offer at $23.50 a share.</p>
</text>
